{"units":[{"id":"hello","emoji":"👋","color":"#2f5d4f","title":"Hello & Introductions","zh":"打招呼","intro":"Greet people, say who you are, and ask people to slow down.","write":["你","好","我","人","大","中","男","女"],"culture":[["Family name first","Chinese names put the family name first, just like Vietnamese names. In 林小玉, the family name is 林 (Lín)."],["不好意思 is everywhere","Taiwanese people say 不好意思 to get attention, to pass someone, or to soften a request. It is polite, not a big apology."],["\"Have you eaten?\"","Older people may greet you with 你吃飽了嗎？ (\"Have you eaten?\"). It just means hello. Answer 吃飽了 (\"I have\") with a smile."],["Teachers","Call teachers 老師 (lǎoshī), even outside class: 林老師, 王老師."]],"hv":null,"phrases":[{"id":"hello-p0","zh":"你好","t":[{"c":"你","p":"nǐ","z":"ㄋㄧˇ","n":"ni3"},{"c":"好","p":"hǎo","z":"ㄏㄠˇ","n":"hao3"}],"en":"Hello."},{"id":"hello-p1","zh":"早安","t":[{"c":"早","p":"zǎo","z":"ㄗㄠˇ","n":"zao3"},{"c":"安","p":"ān","z":"ㄢ","n":"an1"}],"en":"Good morning."},{"id":"hello-p2","zh":"謝謝","t":[{"c":"謝","p":"xiè","z":"ㄒㄧㄝˋ","n":"xie4"},{"c":"謝","p":"xie","z":"˙ㄒㄧㄝ","n":"xie5"}],"en":"Thank you.","hv":"Vietnamese cảm ơn comes from 感恩 (gǎn'ēn), \"to feel grateful.\""},{"id":"hello-p3","zh":"不客氣","t":[{"c":"不","p":"bú","z":"ㄅㄨˊ","n":"bu2"},{"c":"客","p":"kè","z":"ㄎㄜˋ","n":"ke4"},{"c":"氣","p":"qì","z":"ㄑㄧˋ","n":"qi4"}],"en":"You're welcome."},{"id":"hello-p4","zh":"不好意思","t":[{"c":"不","p":"bù","z":"ㄅㄨˋ","n":"bu4"},{"c":"好","p":"hǎo","z":"ㄏㄠˇ","n":"hao3"},{"c":"意","p":"yì","z":"ㄧˋ","n":"yi4"},{"c":"思","p":"si","z":"˙ㄙ","n":"si5"}],"en":"Excuse me. / Sorry.","note":"Used all the time: to get someone's attention, to squeeze past, or for a small apology."},{"id":"hello-p5","zh":"對不起","t":[{"c":"對","p":"duì","z":"ㄉㄨㄟˋ","n":"dui4"},{"c":"不","p":"bu","z":"˙ㄅㄨ","n":"bu5"},{"c":"起","p":"qǐ","z":"ㄑㄧˇ","n":"qi3"}],"en":"I'm sorry.","note":"A real apology. For small things, 不好意思 is more natural."},{"id":"hello-p6","zh":"請問","t":[{"c":"請","p":"qǐng","z":"ㄑㄧㄥˇ","n":"qing3"},{"c":"問","p":"wèn","z":"ㄨㄣˋ","n":"wen4"}],"en":"Excuse me, may I ask…","note":"Start any question to a stranger with 請問."},{"id":"hello-p7","zh":"你叫什麼名字？","t":[{"c":"你","p":"nǐ","z":"ㄋㄧˇ","n":"ni3"},{"c":"叫","p":"jiào","z":"ㄐㄧㄠˋ","n":"jiao4"},{"c":"什","p":"shén","z":"ㄕㄣˊ","n":"shen2"},{"c":"麼","p":"me","z":"˙ㄇㄜ","n":"me5"},{"c":"名","p":"míng","z":"ㄇㄧㄥˊ","n":"ming2"},{"c":"字","p":"zi","z":"˙ㄗ","n":"zi5"},{"c":"？"}],"en":"What's your name?"},{"id":"hello-p8","zh":"我叫小玉。","t":[{"c":"我","p":"wǒ","z":"ㄨㄛˇ","n":"wo3"},{"c":"叫","p":"jiào","z":"ㄐㄧㄠˋ","n":"jiao4"},{"c":"小","p":"xiǎo","z":"ㄒㄧㄠˇ","n":"xiao3"},{"c":"玉","p":"yù","z":"ㄩˋ","n":"yu4"},{"c":"。"}],"en":"My name is Xiao Yu.","hv":"Ngọc is 玉 (yù, jade) in Chinese, so 小玉 is a friendly Chinese nickname for Ngoc."},{"id":"hello-p9","zh":"我是越南人。","t":[{"c":"我","p":"wǒ","z":"ㄨㄛˇ","n":"wo3"},{"c":"是","p":"shì","z":"ㄕˋ","n":"shi4"},{"c":"越","p":"yuè","z":"ㄩㄝˋ","n":"yue4"},{"c":"南","p":"nán","z":"ㄋㄢˊ","n":"nan2"},{"c":"人","p":"rén","z":"ㄖㄣˊ","n":"ren2"},{"c":"。"}],"en":"I'm Vietnamese.","hv":"越南 = Việt Nam."},{"id":"hello-p10","zh":"我是大學生。","t":[{"c":"我","p":"wǒ","z":"ㄨㄛˇ","n":"wo3"},{"c":"是","p":"shì","z":"ㄕˋ","n":"shi4"},{"c":"大","p":"dà","z":"ㄉㄚˋ","n":"da4"},{"c":"學","p":"xué","z":"ㄒㄩㄝˊ","n":"xue2"},{"c":"生","p":"shēng","z":"ㄕㄥ","n":"sheng1"},{"c":"。"}],"en":"I'm a college student.","hv":"大學 = đại học."},{"id":"hello-p11","zh":"我在銘傳大學讀書。","t":[{"c":"我","p":"wǒ","z":"ㄨㄛˇ","n":"wo3"},{"c":"在","p":"zài","z":"ㄗㄞˋ","n":"zai4"},{"c":"銘","p":"míng","z":"ㄇㄧㄥˊ","n":"ming2"},{"c":"傳","p":"chuán","z":"ㄔㄨㄢˊ","n":"chuan2"},{"c":"大","p":"dà","z":"ㄉㄚˋ","n":"da4"},{"c":"學","p":"xué","z":"ㄒㄩㄝˊ","n":"xue2"},{"c":"讀","p":"dú","z":"ㄉㄨˊ","n":"du2"},{"c":"書","p":"shū","z":"ㄕㄨ","n":"shu1"},{"c":"。"}],"en":"I study at Ming Chuan University."},{"id":"hello-p12","zh":"我會說一點中文。","t":[{"c":"我","p":"wǒ","z":"ㄨㄛˇ","n":"wo3"},{"c":"會","p":"huì","z":"ㄏㄨㄟˋ","n":"hui4"},{"c":"說","p":"shuō","z":"ㄕㄨㄛ","n":"shuo1"},{"c":"一","p":"yì","z":"ㄧˋ","n":"yi4"},{