,"t":[{"c":"對","p":"duì","z":"ㄉㄨㄟˋ","n":"dui4"},{"c":"，"},{"c":"我","p":"wǒ","z":"ㄨㄛˇ","n":"wo3"},{"c":"叫","p":"jiào","z":"ㄐㄧㄠˋ","n":"jiao4"},{"c":"阿","p":"ā","z":"ㄚ","n":"a1"},{"c":"玲","p":"líng","z":"ㄌㄧㄥˊ","n":"ling2"},{"c":"。"}],"en":"Yes, my name is A-Ling."},{"id":"hello-d2","who":"A","zh":"你從哪裡來？","t":[{"c":"你","p":"nǐ","z":"ㄋㄧˇ","n":"ni3"},{"c":"從","p":"cóng","z":"ㄘㄨㄥˊ","n":"cong2"},{"c":"哪","p":"nǎ","z":"ㄋㄚˇ","n":"na3"},{"c":"裡","p":"lǐ","z":"ㄌㄧˇ","n":"li3"},{"c":"來","p":"lái","z":"ㄌㄞˊ","n":"lai2"},{"c":"？"}],"en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"hello-d3","who":"B","zh":"我從越南來。","t":[{"c":"我","p":"wǒ","z":"ㄨㄛˇ","n":"wo3"},{"c":"從","p":"cóng","z":"ㄘㄨㄥˊ","n":"cong2"},{"c":"越","p":"yuè","z":"ㄩㄝˋ","n":"yue4"},{"c":"南","p":"nán","z":"ㄋㄢˊ","n":"nan2"},{"c":"來","p":"lái","z":"ㄌㄞˊ","n":"lai2"},{"c":"。"}],"en":"I'm from Vietnam."},{"id":"hello-d4","who":"A","zh":"你的中文很好！","t":[{"c":"你","p":"nǐ","z":"ㄋㄧˇ","n":"ni3"},{"c":"的","p":"de","z":"˙ㄉㄜ","n":"de5"},{"c":"中","p":"zhōng","z":"ㄓㄨㄥ","n":"zhong1"},{"c":"文","p":"wén","z":"ㄨㄣˊ","n":"wen2"},{"c":"很","p":"hěn","z":"ㄏㄣˇ","n":"hen3"},{"c":"好","p":"hǎo","z":"ㄏㄠˇ","n":"hao3"},{"c":"！"}],"en":"Your Chinese is very good!"},{"id":"hello-d5","who":"B","zh":"謝謝！我會說一點中文。請說慢一點。","t":[{"c":"謝","p":"xiè","z":"ㄒㄧㄝˋ","n":"xie4"},{"c":"謝","p":"xie","z":"˙ㄒㄧㄝ","n":"xie5"},{"c":"！"},{"c":"我","p":"wǒ","z":"ㄨㄛˇ","n":"wo3"},{"c":"會","p":"huì","z":"ㄏㄨㄟˋ","n":"hui4"},{"c":"說","p":"shuō","z":"ㄕㄨㄛ","n":"shuo1"},{"c":"一","p":"yì","z":"ㄧˋ","n":"yi4"},{"c":"點","p":"diǎn","z":"ㄉㄧㄢˇ","n":"dian3"},{"c":"中","p":"zhōng","z":"ㄓㄨㄥ","n":"zhong1"},{"c":"文","p":"wén","z":"ㄨㄣˊ","n":"wen2"},{"c":"。"},{"c":"請","p":"qǐng","z":"ㄑㄧㄥˇ","n":"qing3"},{"c":"說","p":"shuō","z":"ㄕㄨㄛ","n":"shuo1"},{"c":"慢","p":"màn","z":"ㄇㄢˋ","n":"man4"},{"c":"一","p":"yì","z":"ㄧˋ","n":"yi4"},{"c":"點","p":"diǎn","z":"ㄉㄧㄢˇ","n":"dian3"},{"c":"。"}],"en":"Thanks! I can speak a little Chinese. Please speak more slowly."},{"id":"hello-d6","who":"A","zh":"好！我叫阿明。很高興認識你。","t":[{"c":"好","p":"hǎo","z":"ㄏㄠˇ","n":"hao3"},{"c":"！"},{"c":"我","p":"wǒ","z":"ㄨㄛˇ","n":"wo3"},{"c":"叫","p":"jiào","z":"ㄐㄧㄠˋ","n":"jiao4"},{"c":"阿","p":"ā","z":"ㄚ","n":"a1"},{"c":"明","p":"míng","z":"ㄇㄧㄥˊ","n":"ming2"},{"c":"。"},{"c":"很","p":"hěn","z":"ㄏㄣˇ","n":"hen3"},{"c":"高","p":"gāo","z":"ㄍㄠ","n":"gao1"},{"c":"興","p":"xìng","z":"ㄒㄧㄥˋ","n":"xing4"},{"c":"認","p":"rèn","z":"ㄖㄣˋ","n":"ren4"},{"c":"識","p":"shì","z":"ㄕˋ","n":"shi4"},{"c":"你","p":"nǐ","z":"ㄋㄧˇ","n":"ni3"},{"c":"。"}],"en":"Sure! I'm A-Ming. Nice to meet you."},{"id":"hello-d7","who":"B","zh":"我也很高興認識你。","t":[{"c":"我","p":"wǒ","z":"ㄨㄛˇ","n":"wo3"},{"c":"也","p":"yě","z":"ㄧㄝˇ","n":"ye3"},{"c":"很","p":"hěn","z":"ㄏㄣˇ","n":"hen3"},{"c":"高","p":"gāo","z":"ㄍㄠ","n":"gao1"},{"c":"興","p":"xìng","z":"ㄒㄧㄥˋ","n":"xing4"},{"c":"認","p":"rèn","z":"ㄖㄣˋ","n":"ren4"},{"c":"識","p":"shì","z":"ㄕˋ","n":"shi4"},{"c":"你","p":"nǐ","z":"ㄋㄧˇ","n":"ni3"},{"c":"。"}],"en":"Nice to meet you, too."}],"quiz":[{"q":"Where is A-Ling from?","a":"Vietnam","wrong":["Taiwan","Japan","Thailand"]},{"q":"What does A-Ling ask A-Ming to do?","a":"Speak more slowly","wrong":["Speak louder","Write it down","Speak English"]},{"q":"Who is the new classmate?","a":"A-Ling","wrong":["A-Ming","Both of them","Neither of them"]}]}},{"id":"store","emoji":"🏪","color":"#c0572b","title":"Convenience Store","zh":"便利商店","intro":"Pay, heat up food, use your EasyCard, and answer the questions clerks always ask.","write":["出","入","口","錢","元","卡","推","拉"],"culture":[["More than a store","At 7-Eleven (people call it 小七, Xiǎo Qī, \"Little Seven\") and FamilyMart (全家, Quánjiā) you can pay bills, print documents, buy train tickets, and pick up online orders."],["Every receipt is a lottery ticket","Taiwan's receipts (發票, fāpiào) have a lottery number. Prizes are drawn every two months, on the 25th of odd-numbered months. Keep your receipts!"],["The e-receipt barcode","A 載具 saves your receipts on your phone, so you don't lose the lottery numbers. You can set one up in the Ministry of Finance e-invoice app."],["The EasyCard","The 悠遊卡 (yōuyóukǎ) works on the MRT, buses, YouBike, and in most convenience stores. You can add money at the store counter."]],"hv":"便利 = tiện lợi, so 便利商店 is literally a \"tiện lợi\" store.","phrases":[{"id":"store-p0","zh":"歡迎光臨！","t":[{"c":"歡","p":"huān","z":"ㄏㄨㄢ","n":"huan1"},{"c":"迎","p":"yíng","z":"ㄧㄥˊ","n":"ying2"},{"c":"光","p":"guāng","z":"ㄍㄨㄤ","n":"guang1"},{"c":"臨","p":"lín","z":"ㄌㄧㄣˊ","n":"lin2"},{"c":"！"}],"en":"Welcome!","note":"Clerks say this every time the door opens. You don't need to answer.","hv":"歡迎 = hoan nghênh."},{"id":"store-p1","zh":"要袋子嗎？","t":[{"c":"要","p":"yào","z":"ㄧㄠˋ","n":"yao4"},{"c":"袋","p":"dài","z":"ㄉㄞˋ","n":"dai4"},{"c":"子","p":"zi","z":"˙ㄗ","n":"zi5"},{"c":"嗎","p":"ma","z":"˙ㄇㄚ","n":"ma5"},{"c":"？"}],"en":"Do you need a bag?","note":"Plastic bags are not free in Taiwan, so clerks always ask."},{"id":"store-p2","zh":"不用，謝謝。","t":[{"c":"不","p":"bú","z":"ㄅㄨˊ","n":"bu2"},{"c":"用","p":"yòng","z":"ㄩㄥˋ","n":"yong4"},{"c":"，"},{"c":"謝","p":"xiè","z":"ㄒㄧㄝˋ","n":"xie4"},{"c":"謝","p":"xie","z":"˙ㄒㄧㄝ","n":"xie5"},{"c":"。"}],"en":"No, thank you."},{"id":"store-p3","zh":"好，要一個。","t":[{"c":"好","p":"hǎo","z":"ㄏㄠˇ","n":"hao3"},{"c":"，"},{"c":"要","p":"yào","z":"ㄧㄠˋ","n":"yao4"},{"c":"一","p":"yí","z":"ㄧˊ","n":"yi2"},{"c":"個","p":"ge","z":"˙ㄍㄜ","n":"ge5"},{"c":"。"}],"en":"Yes, one please."},{"id":"store-p4","zh":"有載具嗎？","t":[{"c":"有","p":"yǒu","z":"ㄧㄡˇ","n":"you3"},{"c":"載","p":"zài","z":"ㄗㄞˋ","n":"zai4"},{"c":"具","p":"jù","z":"ㄐㄩˋ","n":"ju4"},{"c":"嗎","p":"ma","z":"˙ㄇㄚ","n":"ma5"},{"c":"？"}],"en":"Do you have an e-receipt barcode?","note":"A 載具 is a barcode on your phone that saves your receipts. If you don't have one, just say 沒有 (méiyǒu)."},{"id":"store-p5","zh":"沒有。","t":[{"c":"沒","p":"méi","z":"ㄇㄟˊ","n":"mei2"},{"c":"有","p":"yǒu","z":"ㄧㄡˇ","n":"you3"},{"c":"。"}],"en":"No, I don't."},{"id":"store-p6","zh":"要加熱嗎？","t":[{"c":"要","p":"yào","z":"ㄧㄠˋ","n":"yao4"},{"c":"加","p":"jiā","z":"ㄐㄧㄚ","n":"jia1"},{"c":"熱","p":"rè","z"